Additions/Changes from Pokerole 2.0 Character Sheet: 

Colors changed for nearly everything
Typeless and Shadow type now valid types
3.0 Ranks added
Colosseum Ranks added
Concept changed to Archetype
Nature now auto-calculates Attribute Limit increase, decrease and Confidence
Human characters have a working Special Attribute
Stamina Points added and auto-calculate by Rank
Max Will Points auto-calculate from Insight
Legends additional Status Conditions added
Action Sequence tracker added
Initiative Button now always adds to tracker automatically if your token is on the board
Bonus button next to Initiative adds a flat D6 roll to your Initiative in tracker
Insight now auto-calculates Special Defense
Pokeballs can now be rolled for any D6 amount (ie Legends specific balls)
Luck Check button added (rolls 1d100 + 5 for each point you have in Luck Skill)
Armor Bonus field added in Defenses
Legends Skills have been added and are rollable
Extra Skills are now rollable
Happiness and Loyalty are now rollable 
Bond is now rollable (Happiness + Loyalty)
Equipment Pocket displays main hand, off hand, armor, accessory.
Old potions field removed as Potions work differently in Legends
Pokemon now use Training Points
Perk section added (also you can add any 1d[number] you want and roll them)
Move now have all additional rollable skills, attributes, types, targets etc.
